<title>SWITZERLAND: Nestle denies plans Israel chocolate plant.</title>
<headline>Nestle denies plans Israel chocolate plant.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nestle SA denied an Israeli newspaper report that the company intended to set up a chocolate factory in Israel.</p>
<p>&quot;The information is wrong,&quot; a Nestle spokesman said by telephone from company headquarters in Vevey. &quot;There are no plans to build a chocolate facory in Israel.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
